ason i continued  living was for other people  [Music]  i still sometimes look  and i'm searching for the reason to keep  living for myself  [Music]  so my secret is that some wearing  sunglasses kind of makes me feel  more secure confident in what i'm saying  um it  is likened to the effect that being on  the internet and being able to just type  to a screen has it's  weird i broke up with my girlfriend with  my glasses on and i don't think i could  have without them  a lot of my coworkers and friends have  this expectation that i'm so sweet and  so nice to people but i don't think i  live up to those expectations because i  actually really don't like people  i prefer being on my own  [Music]  the only time i've ever been hit on at  work  is by male customers in at least their  30s  who think i'm a lady  i'm a man  i'm 19.  it's happened twice  it's always the same co-worker who is  talking to those customers as well and  he comes over and says hey kiefer  and i say what he says those customers  uh they really like you and i say yeah  and he says yeah they think you're a  chick  and i look at him and  and i'm not happy with him  [Music]  at one of my best friend's graduation  parties i hooked up with his aunt like  15 years ago and i've never told anybody  sometimes when i'm walking down the  street i pretend like i'm a drag queen  performing  on stage a really really long stage  [Music]  so a long time ago when i was little my  cousin and i were just kind of bored and  we  decided to play a little uh prank on uh  the neighbor  so we wrote this like letter saying that  we had like kidnapped her daughter  and that she had to pay like  this amount of money and she had to um  like drop it off in like a certain place  and we're like so little like  the letter probably didn't even make  sense but they eventually like they  found it because we left it like on the  door  and they thought it was real so they  called the cops and like it was a big  thing you know they came 